  "content": "<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>大家好</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我叫Bruno，这是我人生中制作的第一个模组。我给它取名为<strong>碎石提取器 (Create Gravel Extractors)</strong>，我觉得这个名字还不错。此外，该模组的开发已经停止。</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_a580f17c-3bcf-417e-8f2e-3f5d91a7ac14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"185\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_d4d07b01-ef4c-4031-8b87-d062ab5f239d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此模组添加了碎石提取器，可以将碎石转化为以下资源：<strong>煤炭、铜、铁、金、钻石、下界合金、青金石、红石、紫水晶、绿宝石、黄铜粒、安山合金、锌粒</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong>重要信息</strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;此模组<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\">需要</span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Create (机械动力)</span></strong></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>建议安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#169179\">JEI</span></a></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">它适用于任何版本的 Create 模组</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">🖊</span> | <strong>制作工具</strong> | <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">🖊</span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">模组制作工具：<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">MCreator</span></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">贴图制作工具：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.getpaint.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>Paint.net</strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">3D 模型制作工具：<strong><span style=\"color:#0953e5\"><a style=\"color:#0953e5\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.blockbench.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockbench</a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>部分贴图来源于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">Create (机械动力)</span></a></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>其他内容</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>&bull; 所有碎片</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_9666589a-e561-45a0-a4ab-b0065dc557c5.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_64474fe2-546d-4d1b-bb33-04ca10721520.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_0a502ddf-85b5-4d7e-9df1-2e8932d8ddab.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_32cfbff4-a7f1-49f3-b8fd-917b40ae5e85.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_e7b9b462-0f98-4ceb-89b7-78960d230d2f.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_09db19cd-4499-4d58-90c3-19a7d314e402.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_421eec4b-afd6-4277-850e-643055ebc614.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_8e6f7283-3687-492f-892d-f0b7f01599d3.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_b2fd6c0f-dc3a-43ae-8c96-4dfca635b817.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_85e16fc2-6e31-458f-a29d-f7b72973acc5.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_cc296ba4-2670-4095-b181-93673dea8af3.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_c3ccc26d-ab74-4a74-b817-8ad69d4847c1.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_60586583-77eb-4b58-9845-cbbfbb13b340.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_fef6572e-924e-47f5-a942-5dc4a5f8075f.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_d940b234-38a6-4ef6-838b-a8b7b25de5b0.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_6c26d60e-83ce-4cd9-96ee-506041fcda31.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_a5bc9a32-702e-4684-8ccd-a4d442e210cb.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_7450bcef-65bc-482e-8c8e-7cadc049d22e.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>&bull; 提取器</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_d8ce2bfa-8ed1-476e-82c2-5951dff87012.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_bd4fc43c-2ccb-4880-828f-467322c780a2.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_43816a4b-f767-4164-9185-381022eea7ee.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_3933d680-9afc-415f-99f7-c8726f251264.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_aeaf9450-8539-48e8-969d-7ad67be722f5.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_f6bdaca6-0b62-4751-bc61-3bb0b82b0947.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_ca02f1dd-3b39-4932-aabf-6bc7d756eb53.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_f7d06b65-8c7c-4a92-8186-5894eca3771c.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_6ca2ca4b-d516-4b2c-a8d1-b42a9b12a45f.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_cdc07932-0b9e-405a-8e72-72cbffe1f475.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_e51b98d6-ec75-456b-b959-495ea91d58f5.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_e02667d4-b545-495b-8028-3aaabc1445ac.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_490e3e0a-3f2e-4823-bf26-511d991ef385.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_858accfe-bb1d-42ea-9e7e-63e79ae78941.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_9d21c990-eb1e-4219-b061-779e0f7661ab.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_f0b3cc05-7fe6-44b7-931d-9913bd032118.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_59453ab7-d407-4d90-89b5-013525280636.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_f8ca3446-ee87-42bd-9c6b-d1b95d6ed15e.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156507/description_315acab2-ba46-4e91-8cf0-e0a63d17e3a3.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>版本支持：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;- <strong>1.20.1</strong> 支持 (需要 JEI)</p>\n<p>- <strong>1.21.1</strong> 支持并已更新</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>展示视频</strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1J3r8pUje8c\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如需查看完整更新日志，请访问：</strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Brunixon2/Create-CGE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Create: CGE - GitHub</span></strong></a></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>对于希望在整合包中使用此模组的整合包作者：</strong></span></h1>\n<p>首先，您需要前往此模组的 <span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://github.com/Brunixon2/Create-CGE\" rel=\"nofollow\">代码仓库</a></span> 并找到名为 \"<strong>LICENSE</strong>\" 的文件。下载后，您需要将其放入模组的文件中，或者放在整合包文件中的任何位置即可。就这样。</p>\n<p><strong>对于那些在新许可政策实施之前就已经在整合包中安装了此模组的用户，无需添加该文件；但如果您是在许可变更之后创建新的整合包，则需按照上述步骤操作。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
